<title>AUSTRALIA: Centennial withdraws Allied Qld bid.</title>
<headline>Centennial withdraws Allied Qld bid.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centennial Coal Co Ltd said on Wednesday it had withdrawn its 75 cents per share bid for Allied Queensland Coalfields Ltd.  </p>
<p>Centennial said last week it would not raise its bid, which has been bettered by a 78 cent per share bid by Marsford Investments, a unit of Hong Kong's Consolidated Electric Power Asia Ltd.</p>
<p>The New South Wales steaming coal miner said it has returned Allied Queensland scrip to shareholders.</p>
<p>Centennial acquired a 10 percent stake in Allied Queensland earlier this year at 70 cents per share.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
